---
import SiteLayout from '../../components/SiteLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import SoftCta from '../../components/SoftCta.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Inner Child Healing Journey — Songdance"
  description="A guided journey to meet, hear, and tend the younger parts of you — through sound, and gently."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Guided journey"
    title="Inner Child Healing Journey"
    lede="Small voice. Old truth. Finally heard."
    image="/media/library/svh-retreat-walk-tree-sunset.jpg"
  >
    <div class="sd-pagehero-actions">
      <a href="/contact" class="sd-btn sd-btn-primary">Ask about this journey</a>
    </div>
  </PageHero>

  <section class="sd-section sd-prose">
    <div class="sd-prose-inner">
      <p>
        A guided journey to meet, hear, and tend the younger parts of you — through sound, and
        gently. You go at your own pace, with your own voice, and nothing is forced.
      </p>
      <h2 class="sd-prose-h">The high, small sounds</h2>
      <p>
        When the sounds come out high and small, you’ve usually met the child. It remembers in the
        present tense — an old fear looking out through adult eyes at a perfectly safe Tuesday. The
        work is not to scold it for bad reporting. It’s to let it speak, in sound — and being heard
        is what it was waiting for, often for decades.
      </p>
      <blockquote class="sd-lineage-pullquote">“I’m not being hurt — I’m being heard.”</blockquote>
      <p class="sd-italic">— Jacob</p>
      <p>
        This is not regression therapy, and it doesn’t replace therapy. You go at your own pace;
        the voice only opens what you can be with.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <SoftCta />
</SiteLayout>
